              <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 group-hover:text-red-700 dark:group-hover:text-red-300">
                  Credit Card Payoff Calculator
                </h3>
                <div class="px-2 py-1 bg-red-100 dark:bg-red-900 text-red-800 dark:text-red-200 text-xs font-medium rounded-full">
                  New
                </div>
              </div>
              <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-6">
                Optimize credit card debt payoff with balance transfer analysis, 0% APR offers, credit utilization impact, and escape the minimum payment trap.
              </p>
              <div class="space-y-3 mb-6">
                <div class="flex items-center text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-3 text-red-500" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                    <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                  </svg>
                  Balance transfer savings analysis
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-3 text-red-500" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                    <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
